<title>SWITZERLAND: SNB leaves discount rate unchanged after meeting.</title>
<headline>SNB leaves discount rate unchanged after meeting.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss National Bank (SNB) left its discount rate unchanged at 1.00 percent after a regular weekly meeting of its board on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;No change,&quot; an SNB spokesman said.</p>
<p>Market participants had not expected a change in the rate after the SNB lowered the discount rate to 1.00 percent from 1.50 percent on September 26.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
